# Same line endings on every platform: text files are stored and checked out
# with LF, so rustfmt and snapshot tests behave identically on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The WiX source of the Windows installer, written by `dist generate` with
# CRLF line endings: kept byte for byte, so dist does not see it as edited.
crates/sigilfall/wix/main.wxs -text

# Binary assets: never converted nor diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
